  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d54946fbf6f9ef7448aab0bd43163c7f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WorkshopDayController
  seaSceneName: Day3Sea
  menuSceneName: MainMenu
  requiredItem: 
  helpFirstLine: Can you fix Grandpa's compass first? Please?
  tasksDoneAtStart: 1
  interiorPage: {fileID: 929642666}
  benchPage: {fileID: 1881770823}
  screenFader: {fileID: 1684091964}
  bench: {fileID: 1881770821}
  subtitle: {fileID: 1021183663}
  healthText: {fileID: 2004205466}
  coinText: {fileID: 527647108}
  dialogue: {fileID: 1951627952}
  elifLines:
  - Hi, I'm Mert! I was hunting for crabs in the rock pools and... I slipped. Grandpa's
    compass hit the rocks. The glass shattered and the loop snapped.
  - "The needle won't stop spinning. Grandpa always says, \u2018A sailor without
    a compass gets lost at sea.\u2019 Can you fix it before he notices?"
  thanksLines:
  - It points north again! K for kuzey... see? It never lies!
  - Wait... this lens is sea glass! And the loop is made of ghost-net rope?
  - "Grandpa always says, \u2018The sea gives us everything. Let's not give it our
    trash.\u2019 Now I finally get it."
  - Here, take this! And from now on I'll help you too. I know every rock pool on
    this beach!
